    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "WELCOME TO FORT VIEW  -  THE NEW RESIDENTIAL QUARTER OF CAVAN TOWN\r\n\r\nA development by Fitzpatrick and Heavey Homes, Ireland's leading residential developer, creating premium homes in Irish towns and cities across the country. Set on an elevated site overlooking the Cavan countryside, Fort View is a new collection of A-Rated 2, 3 and 4-bedroom homes. Named after the historic fort overlooking the development, Fort View offers something increasingly hard to find: a superbly built, energy-efficient home with countryside views, green spaces on your doorstep, and a busy regional town with all the amenities you need just minutes away.\r\nFitzpatrick and Heavey Homes have built their reputation on dynamic design and premium craftsmanship, and it shows in every home at Fort View, from the structure through to the final finish.\r\n\r\nInside, each home is designed for modern family life: bright, welcoming interiors, stylish fitted kitchens, and well-planned layouts that make the most of space, storage and natural light. A-Rated energy-efficient construction delivers year-round comfort while keeping running costs low.\r\nFor buyers seeking a more balanced lifestyle, Fort View is hard to beat. Located on the outskirts of Cavan town with access to Dublin, the North and the West via the N3, these homes offer the space, affordability and quality of life that city living simply can't match.\r\n\r\nFrom its elevated position, the development enjoys open countryside views that give every home a real sense of space and light. Green space is woven through the development itself, with landscaped areas and communal hubs where children can play and neighbours can meet.\r\nCavan town - with its shops, restaurants, schools and services - is just minutes away. Cavan General Hospital and other major employers are within easy reach, good schools and childcare facilities are close by, and a new early learning centre forms part of the development. The Drumlark road into town has footpaths, cycle lanes and road lighting, with excellent road links to surrounding towns.\r\n\r\nWhether it's your first home or your next home, Fort View offers a rare combination: a superbly built, A-Rated home in an elevated countryside setting, just minutes from town.\r\n\r\n4 Bed Detached From €470,000."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "The Swellan. New Spacious A Rated 4 Bed Detached Modern Home. House TYpe D/D1 144 sqM"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "1.New A-Rated 2, 3 & 4 bedroom homes\r\n2.Elevated Development with scenic views\r\n3.Contemporary interiors & kitchens with Quartz counter tops\r\n4.Energy-efficient, low running costs\r\n5.Landscaped open green spaces\r\n6.Minutes from Cavan Town Centre\r\n7.10-Year HomeBond Structural Warranty\r\n8.Registered for Help to Buy & First Home Scheme"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: A"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "From Cavan Town Centre: From the town centre, take the Cathedral Road towards Butlersbridge. After Maxol Filling Station, turn left towards Butlersbridge and continue along the road towards Drumgola & Drumlark. The Fort View Development is lcayed on your left, approximately c.3 km from Cavan town centre.\r\n\r\nFrom the N3: Exit the N3 at the Drumgola/Drumgola Wood junction and follow the signs towards Drumgola. Continue along the local road towards Drumlark. The Fort View Development is approximately c.2 km from the N3."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "Content": "VIEWING DETAILS  \r\n***SHOWHOUSE COMING SOON***\r\nOur Show House will be open for Viewing in the coming weeks. We are looking forward to opening the doors and welcoming all local househunters to come and take a look!\r\n\r\nViewing Strictly by Appointment only with the Sole Selling Agents - O'Reilly, Taylor & Tweedy\r\n\r\n**CONTACT ESTATE AGENTS\r\nEamon F. O'Reilly - PH: 086-2788094\r\nMartin J. O'Reilly  - PH:  087-9790094"
      }
